  "cost": 0,
  "interpretation": "<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th><strong>Result</strong></th>\n<th><strong>Possible Clinical Significance</strong></th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>PAS Positive</strong></td>\n<td>- <strong>Leukemias</strong>: Positive coarse granular PAS in lymphoblasts (esp. ALL). - <strong>Storage diseases</strong>: Glycogen accumulation (e.g., glycogen storage disease). - <strong>Fungal infections</strong>: Highlights fungal cell walls (e.g., Candida, Histoplasma). - <strong>Mucopolysaccharidoses</strong>: Excess mucopolysaccharides in tissues. - <strong>Basement membranes / connective tissue</strong>: Thickened membranes (diabetic nephropathy, glomerulopathies).</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>PAS Negative</strong></td>\n<td>Suggests absence of significant glycogen, mucopolysaccharides, or fungal elements. Normal in many tissues.</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
